          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "19",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Batisheba nao aya na ku mfumu Solomoni mukuya landilako Adoniya. Ilyo afika, imfumu yaima pa cipuna yaisa mukumanya, yakontamiko mutwe elyo yaya ikala pa cipuna. Elyo yaeba na bakuleta icipuna apakwisa ikala nyina, baciteka na ku kuboko kwa kulyo kwa cipuna ca mfumu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.2.19",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.2.19"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "20",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 2:20"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "20",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Batisheba nyina alanda ati, “Kuli icintu cimo ico ndefwaya ukulomba kuli iwe, wintana iyoo.” Imfumu yayasuka aiti, “Lombeni mayo ine nshakaane.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.2.20",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.2.20"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "21",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 2:21"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "21",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Elyo Batisheba nyina ati, “Suminisha ukuti Abishagi umwina Shunemu opwe kuli munonko Adoniya.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.2.21",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.2.21"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "22",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 2:22"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "22",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Imfumu Solomoni yayasuka nyina aiti, “Nga cinshi waipushisha Abishagi umwina Shunemu ukuti opwe kuli Adoniya? Ici cena calangafye ukuti no bufumu bwine kuti wamulombela apofye mukalamba wandi elyo kabili na Abiyata shimapepo, na Yoabu mwana Seruiya bawila kuli ena.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.2.22",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.2.22"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "22",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 2:22"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "22",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.2.22",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.2.22"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "23",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 2:23"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "23",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Elyo imfumu Solomoni yalapa peshina lyakwa Yawe ati, “Lesa ancitile icili conse nangufye icakuleta ishamo nga cakuti Adoniya taleke umweo pa mashiwi asosa. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.2.23",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.2.23"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "24",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 2:24"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "24",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Eico mu cishinkafye cakwa Yawe umumi uwambika bwino pa cipuna cakwa tata Davidi kabili ampeela ne ŋanda ngefyo alaile, lelo line Adoniya alafwa.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.2.24",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.2.24"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "25",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 2:25"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "25",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Apopene imfumu Solomoni yapeela ne cipope kuli Benaya mwana Yehoiyada ukuya ipaya Adoniya, nao aya mwipaya.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.2.25",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.2.25"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "25",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 2:25"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "25",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.2.25",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.2.25"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "26",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 2:26"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "26",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Elyo imfumu yaebele Abiyata shimapepo ukuti, “Bwelelamo kumwenu ku Anatoti. Iwe ulingile ukufwa, lelo nshakwipaye pali ino nshita pantu walibombele umulimo wakusenda Imbokoshi ya Cipangano iya Mfumu Yawe pa cinso cakwa tata Davidi no kupita nankwe pamo mu macushi.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.2.26",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.2.26"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "27",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 2:27"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "27",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "1SA.2.27+1SA.2.28+1SA.2.29+1SA.2.30+1SA.2.31+1SA.2.32+1SA.2.33+1SA.2.34+1SA.2.35+1SA.2.36"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "1 Sam 2:27-36",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Elyo imfumu Solomoni yafumya Abiyata pa milimo ya bushimapepo bwakwa Yawe mukufikilisha amashiwi yakwa Yawe ayasoselwe ku Shilo palwa ŋanda yakwa Eli.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.2.27",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.2.27"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "27",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 2:27"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "27",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.2.27",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.2.27"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "28",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 2:28"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "28",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ilyo amashiwi ya fyacitike yafika kuli Yaobu, pakuba uwasuminishe Adoniya nangu tasuminisheko ifyakwa Abusalomu, ena epakubutukila mwi Tenti lyakwa Yawe no kuya konena ku nsengo sha bulambo. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.2.28",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.2.28"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "29",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 2:29"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "29",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Baisa eba imfumu Solomoni ukuti Yoabu nabutukila mwi Tenti lyakwa Yawe emo ekele kumbali ya bulambo. Elyo imfumu Solomoni yapeela icipope kuli Benaya mwana Yehoiyada ukuti, “Kabiye uye umwipaye.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.2.29",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.2.29"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "30",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 2:30"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "30",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Benaya epakuya, aya ingila mwi Tenti lyakwa Yawe no kweba Yoabu ati, “Imfumu itile, ‘Fumina panse.’” Yoabu nao ayasuka ati, “Awe ine nshafume, ndefwilafye muno mwine.” Benaya epakuya eba imfumu Solomoni amashiwi yasosele Yoabu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.2.30",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.2.30"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "31",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 2:31"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "31",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Elyo imfumu yapeela Benaya icipope cakuti, “Iwe kacite ifyo asosele. Kamukome, umwipaye no kumushiika, pakuti ufumye pali ine na pa ŋanda yakwa tata umulandu wa mulopa wakaele ulya Yoabu asumishe apabula umulandu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.2.31",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.2.31"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "32",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 2:32"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "32",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Yawe euli nokumukanda pa mulopa asumishe pantu, ukwabula ukuti tata Davidi eshibe, aimine no kusansa abantu babili no kubepaya ku lupanga. Aba babili, ni Abune mwana Neri uwali umukalamba wa fita fya nkondo fya bena Israeli, na Amasa mwana Yete umukalamba wa fita fya nkondo fya bena Yuda. Aba bali abantu abacishinka ukucila pali ena. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.2.32",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.2.32"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "33",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 2:33"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "33",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "No mulandu wa mulopa wa pali aba bantu uli nokutulumana pa mutwe wakwa Yoabu na ba mu lupwa lwakwe pe na pe. Lelo pali Davidi na ba mu lupwa lwakwe, pa ba ŋanda yakwe na pa cipuna cakwe, pena palebafye umutende wakwa Yawe pe na pe.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.2.33",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.2.33"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "34",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 2:34"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "34",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Elyo Benaya mwana Yehoiyada aile no kuya koma Yoabu no kumwipaya, no kuya mushiika mu mpanga iyakwe iyali mu matololo.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.2.34",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.2.34"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "34",
            "style": "v",
